Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 02:11:38 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 23/83] Unified: task panel only while in use; new part starts
 with its sketch; context bar only for picks

- The task panel is shown while a tool uses it and hidden otherwise,
  instead of an empty column taking space next to the 3D view.
- "New Part" on the start page goes straight to choosing where to draw
  the first sketch.
- The context bar follows picks in the 3D view (left button released over
  it) and no longer pops up for selections made by commands, e.g. the
  new body being selected.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
